  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing methane emissions through an integrated data approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to accelerate reductions of methane emissions by integrating and reconciling emissions data sources, linking findings to ambitious action, and supporting the science-policy interface. It will do by supporting the activities of the International Methane Emission Observatory (IMEO) with a view to increase the use of data by governments and companies in order to design and adopt methane emission mitigation strategies and targets. The objectives of the action are fully in line with C</narrative>
  </description>
